  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Stevenson, as we recall, once dedicated his birthday to a young child—was it a girl or a boy?",
      "output_sha256": "d3c3362a40f02757a52238c919613c702508078b7931c622481b36b5a4b337bb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.563095,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1844ab213c965d2f7b900c06c80293f197f2bc0c9e0a3db475200ebcbb2e7a2d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d3c3362a40f02757a52238c919613c702508078b7931c622481b36b5a4b337bb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The child was fond of birthdays, while he had reached a time of life when they had ceased to have any interest for him.",
      "output_sha256": "af9bdc35e37fdeae2f8a053112e32b2d4869caca114b74bf95c714beffa43eb5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "af9bdc35e37fdeae2f8a053112e32b2d4869caca114b74bf95c714beffa43eb5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Many of us, if we live long enough, inevitably encounter this sense of indifference.",
      "output_sha256": "23a5dff636917ff695caea61e3f1407d8296d3d1ffb3b08338018ab3bc61821e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.581506,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "28778ec1954f48fc5e4df2ba417b053f05a0eef562e2ebd1ad2ae31b3e28d7f3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "23a5dff636917ff695caea61e3f1407d8296d3d1ffb3b08338018ab3bc61821e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The thrill of birthdays dissipates along with the toys that once sparked that joy.",
      "output_sha256": "e628b22255a67f7bee75185cd008c0e5200936d3bbf843e3e24ad9876c13484c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.405357,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "185bacbeca085737e6572508a7915cef4ff4f320ae02ae679810208b3045de14"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e628b22255a67f7bee75185cd008c0e5200936d3bbf843e3e24ad9876c13484c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I remember when life was a journey from one birthday to another, the tedium of which was only relieved by such agreeable incidents as Christmas, Easter, and the school holidays.",
      "output_sha256": "927f8593e88f5997864b4fce53d38ba72f42488d9cc8901479cf6b2312b3e29c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "927f8593e88f5997864b4fce53d38ba72f42488d9cc8901479cf6b2312b3e29c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But for many years I have stumbled up against my birthday, as it were, with a shock of surprise, have given it a nod of recognition as one might greet an ancient acquaintance with whom one has lost sympathy, and have passed on without a further thought about the occasion.",
      "output_sha256": "a85ffaf8ce0e035038d78c620dac25eea1341b3785ca2207746d5ad98a8e369b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "a85ffaf8ce0e035038d78c620dac25eea1341b3785ca2207746d5ad98a8e369b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Today, however, feels different.",
      "output_sha256": "1f690c0bdfd92a239f917cbcaf1da90c9f67908c546d3b9c5046d9fffd40ab90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.32,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1929e202f6660ffaf85e6beab3473dbc16e87c3092e0e8ae73f291eb9b9e532a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f690c0bdfd92a239f917cbcaf1da90c9f67908c546d3b9c5046d9fffd40ab90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One cannot simply overlook the significance of turning fifty; it is a milestone that demands recognition.",
      "output_sha256": "f7b10560ea0f627975cb0ccbd011b4a6218a17327e48fcc64d2281ada12007d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.346579,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "110f23789cc3a93f50a940528e9c7196cce54976e2058546cfa5b729e54e329f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f7b10560ea0f627975cb0ccbd011b4a6218a17327e48fcc64d2281ada12007d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Fifty!",
      "output_sha256": "5f465c4abcd819f9dabf6a72a082b98d38a57e14fcb104ea2386868b7acdc95f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f465c4abcd819f9dabf6a72a082b98d38a57e14fcb104ea2386868b7acdc95f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, the Psalmist's limit is only seventy.",
      "output_sha256": "2bf494215bc592602bca40e3c301674cef39af5a2a615a8059be29ec3bb446d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "2bf494215bc592602bca40e3c301674cef39af5a2a615a8059be29ec3bb446d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Fifty from seventy.",
      "output_sha256": "3b3d79afa17379a6dcca05236f97200e1436793dacaa3bcbd626ef3852c31404",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b3d79afa17379a6dcca05236f97200e1436793dacaa3bcbd626ef3852c31404",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An easy sum, but what an impressive answer!",
      "output_sha256": "86302f0491abf2055275e0227df29fc7edc083e421e6ef9c8754e8c4ac51bc2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "86302f0491abf2055275e0227df29fc7edc083e421e6ef9c8754e8c4ac51bc2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Twenty years, and they the years of the sere, the yellow leaf.",
      "output_sha256": "0421755f881c99a1aba1b8bdf86739e7c24d99e7dc5439347d1a026136a76e66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "0421755f881c99a1aba1b8bdf86739e7c24d99e7dc5439347d1a026136a76e66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Only twenty more times to hear the cuckoo calling over the valley and see the dark beech woods bursting into tender green.",
      "output_sha256": "2fdf7d7eb8cef3a98b9f07e291432d9b77bf9b9d1427d5b355edc7e7d43d117d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fdf7d7eb8cef3a98b9f07e291432d9b77bf9b9d1427d5b355edc7e7d43d117d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I look back twenty years, and it seems only a span.",
      "output_sha256": "00315692cbaa95ffab1b0b7fd65523b4a3b05191a98ee8af10e4ffafad6133d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "00315692cbaa95ffab1b0b7fd65523b4a3b05191a98ee8af10e4ffafad6133d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And yet how remote fifty seemed in those days!",
      "output_sha256": "7bda0644ad392ff37b99d46b751ec3b76282fa2a526c488d576c04a5e7703d59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "7bda0644ad392ff37b99d46b751ec3b76282fa2a526c488d576c04a5e7703d59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was so remote as to be hardly worth thinking about.",
      "output_sha256": "90302de6b7cf7f5ca064fd9e000e709648336714eb3f72ceae0868eb74c8747e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "90302de6b7cf7f5ca064fd9e000e709648336714eb3f72ceae0868eb74c8747e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To be fifty was to be among the old fellows, to be on the shelf, to have become an antiquity.",
      "output_sha256": "96b7e2e6dc17b4cff8a04fb3b4c5d4718eb16c7dfb68c5625b4fecd6160454e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "96b7e2e6dc17b4cff8a04fb3b4c5d4718eb16c7dfb68c5625b4fecd6160454e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, standing at fifty years of age, I do not feel like an artifact at all; instead, I feel as youthful as I ever did.",
      "output_sha256": "ea20f2272bfb7d09f0e9e1dbc10f4c9d683fb244cc6d62912a13ece99579d034",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.361939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "321324b0941170394c99a28832a9c8ba9960319d9c6fb714c145680d1d1af645"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea20f2272bfb7d09f0e9e1dbc10f4c9d683fb244cc6d62912a13ece99579d034",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I had feared that entering middle age would bring with it a sense of nostalgia for the joys of my youth, a longing for the past that would make life feel unbearable.",
      "output_sha256": "f5d88de6569fd9e698f6a146eff6b53db1781ae47ff0f96b316df94d9cc79649",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.388826,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1bc2883e5a0c62d58841f5df829fbfa70f74f17b197b17aae00c47938e89543a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f5d88de6569fd9e698f6a146eff6b53db1781ae47ff0f96b316df94d9cc79649",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How would life be tolerable when cricket, for example, had ceased to play an important part in it?",
      "output_sha256": "d569745e5d63bbbbcb13614a66ab8ee78ae2f8e21abf1b6d90fdeed96aaa15e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "d569745e5d63bbbbcb13614a66ab8ee78ae2f8e21abf1b6d90fdeed96aaa15e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Never again to have the ecstasy of a drive along \"the carpet\" to the boundary or, with a flash of the arm, snapping an opponent in the slips.",
      "output_sha256": "0e51f2d63a2b1f7403e920168a7d19092fd052365b9e19a3f6122d777a07fc8f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "0e51f2d63a2b1f7403e920168a7d19092fd052365b9e19a3f6122d777a07fc8f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What a dreary desolation life must be, stripped of those joys!",
      "output_sha256": "e03fedf0e80bdd165135bdc1bb1f687d4f0b052bc0a32a8bbbcff166397db609",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "e03fedf0e80bdd165135bdc1bb1f687d4f0b052bc0a32a8bbbcff166397db609",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, I’ve come to realize that the essence of youth is not contingent upon cricket or childhood delights.",
      "output_sha256": "61c61a491ab677e4845f015bd2c589f082f14e393daab4d276e9835355a8f302",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.299581,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "13d3ce15162206454c44d9a122290b323ae6541f3f11ddf4e32d6699a90facab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "61c61a491ab677e4845f015bd2c589f082f14e393daab4d276e9835355a8f302",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is rooted in an acceptance of the possibilities life offers.",
      "output_sha256": "003a4b28fa951933c4d6915f849f00cc93a3e3da39c262141c8c9a1ea454a353",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.417143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "21f430a4889e61db86e9f015d9460a3998b61a17f3f368da1fc0f5c01d3e688d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "003a4b28fa951933c4d6915f849f00cc93a3e3da39c262141c8c9a1ea454a353",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Do not suppose, young fellow, that you are any younger than I am because you can jump five feet eight and I have ceased to want to jump at all.",
      "output_sha256": "dd09d786ed15d0e99b0fe10c3c85ee99f19462bd60ad45113a0fd2a527a3ead9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd09d786ed15d0e99b0fe10c3c85ee99f19462bd60ad45113a0fd2a527a3ead9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The spirit of youth is a far deeper and more persistent quality than mere physical prowess.",
      "output_sha256": "342e8a399144ddff1656892640105d71300e0b8bf2b830e64db229834c6fc3d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.484135,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0db84e9910d55e351c05b75241046cdc0f5a8612a7932c0c4630a4608d06c0a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "342e8a399144ddff1656892640105d71300e0b8bf2b830e64db229834c6fc3d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It may be as vigorous at eighty as it is at eighteen.",
      "output_sha256": "a818e84f4743deecab329a149a4dacf3453894687acff90b91abffa3d627447b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "a818e84f4743deecab329a149a4dacf3453894687acff90b91abffa3d627447b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is only its manner of expression which is changed.",
      "output_sha256": "d8cdb56bae8e11d6114ebcf15627cbc4e963845ae10a105ef61da37b4d4ef86f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8cdb56bae8e11d6114ebcf15627cbc4e963845ae10a105ef61da37b4d4ef86f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Holmes never admitted that he had grown old.",
      "output_sha256": "13955634399581cda55f7228119050e334019fd93b8311f37471a528017691f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "13955634399581cda55f7228119050e334019fd93b8311f37471a528017691f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"I am eighty-three young to-day,\" he would say.",
      "output_sha256": "7d835e0d607db90a08bf4b4e77e4fe82928d0ce3540161d687b8f5757dfe8d69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d835e0d607db90a08bf4b4e77e4fe82928d0ce3540161d687b8f5757dfe8d69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Likewise, Johnson, despite his age and ailments, insisted he was “a young fellow”—and indeed, he embodied a sprightly spirit that defied the ravages of time.",
      "output_sha256": "b9b1da80d24eec94fa6bd22d3a0c76eb3ec361ad299cb2d4ad4a628499d01dac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.425285,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "289e47d50932106ebdafa2e3104384122802ce30b4831c2eb3b15db4fe6d4ee6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b9b1da80d24eec94fa6bd22d3a0c76eb3ec361ad299cb2d4ad4a628499d01dac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Youth is, in truth, not merely a physical condition but rather a matter of the soul.",
      "output_sha256": "534fa16849d3953adaee5194b5a4b692605ef4fa43a91caf8f671cd0fa55eb0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.584943,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f4be5140ed06a72b968a6287212670625bfe83a27eade645e3347e11a89896bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "534fa16849d3953adaee5194b5a4b692605ef4fa43a91caf8f671cd0fa55eb0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One can feel spiritually aged at twenty-five or retain a lively, youthful spirit at eighty.",
      "output_sha256": "d4f7bf7b6fcff66bc82732c17f6d4cc066a3322cfeaeed3f9d6eaa2ea9382153",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.460158,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9a4fd81c5494f29b3502a8da4bd24e2e36bd944fb1a53352812355cd7d1ca97"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d4f7bf7b6fcff66bc82732c17f6d4cc066a3322cfeaeed3f9d6eaa2ea9382153",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Byron was only thirty-four when he wrote:—",
      "output_sha256": "ab7878246fa63c668dedb321e11bf476d262d7c29f352da52688feb5349bcfc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab7878246fa63c668dedb321e11bf476d262d7c29f352da52688feb5349bcfc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am ashes where once I was fire.",
      "output_sha256": "d7209322f242f71d6f26ccf72b00eb43494aab50d111977ba423d1a190e6c1fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7209322f242f71d6f26ccf72b00eb43494aab50d111977ba423d1a190e6c1fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And the soul in my bosom is dead; What I loved I now merely admire, And my heart is as grey as my head.",
      "output_sha256": "8f70bd65ed95f1b4c47a981daa42ab7338dfa764012772b771114f714be8b4c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f70bd65ed95f1b4c47a981daa42ab7338dfa764012772b771114f714be8b4c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps there was some affectation in this, for Byron was always dramatising himself.",
      "output_sha256": "39d6df13c54cab55236a493d641d974f469d101db6d9f0b1a24e3dd12639c2fc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "39d6df13c54cab55236a493d641d974f469d101db6d9f0b1a24e3dd12639c2fc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But that he died an old man at thirty-six is as indisputable as that Browning died a young man at seventy-seven, with that triumphant envoi of Asolando as his last expression of the eternal youth of the soul.",
      "output_sha256": "0d572f8a5b4dd19a772cdcb27033ec23a895c11ae9dbae471d3fd0b788381a1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d572f8a5b4dd19a772cdcb27033ec23a895c11ae9dbae471d3fd0b788381a1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In thinking of old age, the mistake is to assume that the spirit must decay with the body.",
      "output_sha256": "50d3895f3839f67b326f5c615ff914df399609d5fd2bc9ba2e31fa94c7f019e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "50d3895f3839f67b326f5c615ff914df399609d5fd2bc9ba2e31fa94c7f019e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Naturally, if the body is treated poorly, its consequences will affect the spirit.",
      "output_sha256": "bf177e104f01cf305cbbb5590d876900084c48e89e7c4536e0a8d9df837a25ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.524126,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e2076e2b9e77d383870696660b3347e31c76ef8301a193cdba38e047a8e35024"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bf177e104f01cf305cbbb5590d876900084c48e89e7c4536e0a8d9df837a25ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the natural decline of the physical powers leaves the healthy spirit untouched with age, should indeed leave it strengthened—glowing not with passion but with a steadier fire.",
      "output_sha256": "8da17c35b3429f5ccd9e7e5f4d397ec8523f779b50e22dc0bddea5964a06e197",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "8da17c35b3429f5ccd9e7e5f4d397ec8523f779b50e22dc0bddea5964a06e197",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When we are young in years our eager spirit cries for the moon.",
      "output_sha256": "7b0c2ec899bc4e8cf5a83ee47844e93ec145f95b7bc6b393a6af9acba44fb04b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b0c2ec899bc4e8cf5a83ee47844e93ec145f95b7bc6b393a6af9acba44fb04b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We look before and after, And pine for what is not.",
      "output_sha256": "6972dc4c42dd9782b6f0b5d720b685ae93ec2c93c145c26beb040768641c3f87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "6972dc4c42dd9782b6f0b5d720b685ae93ec2c93c145c26beb040768641c3f87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But as we get older we learn to be satisfied with something nearer than the moon.",
      "output_sha256": "441d9b743075349ca9ccebf0049e896c75cf7402f180ec8b500620b364123331",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "441d9b743075349ca9ccebf0049e896c75cf7402f180ec8b500620b364123331",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The scope of our aspirations may narrow, but the vastness of our existence remains unchanged, leading to the realization that what truly matters is often right at our fingertips.",
      "output_sha256": "ce37136db0192f8fedd791a15ad9f8be8ce7da1748865b258d74d4b6d60a6fd1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.319775,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d186aa76381b102c04a83fee8352cb3bcd258ae9ceb3cd97b1d849db02299dc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce37136db0192f8fedd791a15ad9f8be8ce7da1748865b258d74d4b6d60a6fd1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is the homing of the spirit.",
      "output_sha256": "787d21a3cd53d1c73333e15fcf6d1aca853bbc67418f46dcad614b5f7ee7feda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "787d21a3cd53d1c73333e15fcf6d1aca853bbc67418f46dcad614b5f7ee7feda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We have been avid of the \"topless grandeurs\" of life, and we return to find that the spiritual satisfactions we sought were all the time within very easy reach.",
      "output_sha256": "fd7dde3915d11604b5c6a9feab730c7931d838b925734ee5cea9b12fd59affce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd7dde3915d11604b5c6a9feab730c7931d838b925734ee5cea9b12fd59affce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And in cultivating those satisfactions intensively we make another discovery.",
      "output_sha256": "672699853424475ad502390893a821f0d8050e1e5cbb3096de284a5a3ecbbf71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "672699853424475ad502390893a821f0d8050e1e5cbb3096de284a5a3ecbbf71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We find that this is the true way to the \"topless grandeurs\" themselves, for those topless grandeurs are not without us but within.",
      "output_sha256": "a9aa8f31f6a32f5ba46a52581f550c1553104c4f6b1292db504f0be76ebe3ba2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9aa8f31f6a32f5ba46a52581f550c1553104c4f6b1292db504f0be76ebe3ba2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I fear I might be preaching now, and that is not my intention, yet if there were ever a time to reflect on such matters, it would be as I celebrate my fifty years.",
      "output_sha256": "15a8ad94607eaed471fe4b193df5a78d79d0e7192d4b4de40aca1305208806e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.30804,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5583290d769114307b12616fa22b6c9409ac984047a1f078df6f0e4de4d8683e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15a8ad94607eaed471fe4b193df5a78d79d0e7192d4b4de40aca1305208806e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let me as an antidote recall a little story which the present Bishop of Chester once told me over the dinner table, for it contains a practical recipe for keeping the heart young.",
      "output_sha256": "935363894398e08528051efc203cd4d9b31608d87ba8bad6f6c6fd32806c587f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "935363894398e08528051efc203cd4d9b31608d87ba8bad6f6c6fd32806c587f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In his younger days, he worked with Archdeacon Jones of Liverpool, who, at over eighty, had once been a tutor to Gladstone.",
      "output_sha256": "a33705d75f27ea79333a3d34ea4658db36343e0de400f78e22b9849638c339ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.438163,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0938f9b9589a0470cfd7454222a44c7396815baa11240d743a006fa68b5bc14b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a33705d75f27ea79333a3d34ea4658db36343e0de400f78e22b9849638c339ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Archdeacon, then over eighty, had been tutor to Gladstone, and one day the future Bishop turned the conversation into a reminiscent channel, and sought to evoke the Archdeacon's memories of the long past.",
      "output_sha256": "377a7c904b4eb6018412fcc63eab4d97a38f2226cbdd66f1a3568435968e56f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "377a7c904b4eb6018412fcc63eab4d97a38f2226cbdd66f1a3568435968e56f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Suddenly, the Archdeacon shifted the topic, asking, “What was the Philharmonic concert like last night?”",
      "output_sha256": "c74292bf89cb12551a1aa85d1a8f06ef7ac5435ea01293c6ebd211b199e6f845",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.639071,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c2e5d7b319f37d76c43ffcd69e123649816f3b12d752894a4cf902e85b3d85e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c74292bf89cb12551a1aa85d1a8f06ef7ac5435ea01293c6ebd211b199e6f845",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And then, in answer to the obvious surprise which the question had aroused, he added, \"Although I am an old man, I want to keep my heart young, and the best way of doing that is not to let one's thoughts live in the past, but to keep them in tune with the life around one.\"",
      "output_sha256": "22abdb736b3f5889b94547ff78cbf07917182d9407d03340c63898dd3b3c0e65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "22abdb736b3f5889b94547ff78cbf07917182d9407d03340c63898dd3b3c0e65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The truth is that every stage of the journey has its own interests.",
      "output_sha256": "9283f634f021d18892742f7838ae37cdd877fa7b5f7760f423c0d526d43d4cc4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "9283f634f021d18892742f7838ae37cdd877fa7b5f7760f423c0d526d43d4cc4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "None is necessarily superior to another, though I have always favored the stage in which I currently find myself.",
      "output_sha256": "cdeb3123d459b94f60b84b981a9582730c980c2f4678cac04baf2728e8a431ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.35834,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b85dc1533abaa3696966a1884bd4bf644d30e13c32c25c36ee4cfd329095e9ad"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cdeb3123d459b94f60b84b981a9582730c980c2f4678cac04baf2728e8a431ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At twenty, I believed there was no age quite like that, and now that I am fifty, I have transferred my enthusiasm to this present age.",
      "output_sha256": "65a08bd68faca80365a65c980f291cd1c6d742a825a5c7011ea600d1bef8f3ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.701473,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d753bee55e3092a70e434ababcfedb3ab3d2981abdaef16d2cbf905254981327"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "65a08bd68faca80365a65c980f291cd1c6d742a825a5c7011ea600d1bef8f3ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is no age like it, I feel, for all-round enjoyment.",
      "output_sha256": "7be144f7294e1db8d8edb3f351f7b84f1863a2e0878b0d3cc7867879d1371dd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "7be144f7294e1db8d8edb3f351f7b84f1863a2e0878b0d3cc7867879d1371dd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I genuinely believe that if fortune permits me to reach sixty, I will proclaim that there is no age like sixty.",
      "output_sha256": "5cfa385e6647ad91937ff732fa49a2ba86758dc7aa5df341a0532318f3814ddd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.531393,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "621ff890e0834573e7645056f58e2c980723ef22cde23cbdc79ebdb23972a2de"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5cfa385e6647ad91937ff732fa49a2ba86758dc7aa5df341a0532318f3814ddd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And why not?",
      "output_sha256": "9acddaf33384d87c3770de63d6c4a1a3f92edf1e5db3a0833c542e60f5289c05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "9acddaf33384d87c3770de63d6c4a1a3f92edf1e5db3a0833c542e60f5289c05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is pleasant to see the sun on the morning hills, but it is not less pleasant to walk home when the shadows are lengthening and the cool of the evening has come.",
      "output_sha256": "21bf163278d79edd861db4cab1c0a2aa0329c064d27e02d64286793c705be95d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "21bf163278d79edd861db4cab1c0a2aa0329c064d27e02d64286793c705be95d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
